# SET_FRAME (module/frames_sim.c): HELLO bit 14; chunks don't reply; SHOW draws the left at once
# and sends the right only what changed (a fill for one colour, nothing for a static frame), at
# most every 100 ms with the newest frame; bad requests answer 5; RELEASE, the timeout and an
# endpoint change hand both halves back, the last two with an unsolicited D7 8C (event 1).
/^frames:/p
/^hostlink: rx D7 8C/p
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
